{"item_id": "9fd1ef591791fecf", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "海外独立站上线 7 个月 我收获月度订阅5000$+", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vQbr6SESY", "project_url": null, "author": "海外独立站老石", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/245510554", "published_at": "2026-08-18T11:10:59+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-25T00:04:20+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "海外独立站上线 7 个月 我收获月度订阅$5000+\n\n一开始源于一个简单的想法，vibecoding大概1周多时间 后来陆续迭代\n\n当然收入还包含不少成本，整体也还是向上走的。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 14221, "danmaku": 1, "favorites": 1029}, "tags": ["vibe coding", "海外独立站", "seo", "独立开发者", "独立开发"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1vQbr6SESY", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vQbr6SESY", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260924T235719"}
{"item_id": "9da893e06d4b9e78", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "失踪人口回归！我的第一个出海产品，是怎样冷启动赚到第一个 100 美元的？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "project_url": "https://tailwindresume.co/", "author": "独立开发者Viking", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/480241067", "published_at": "2025-03-17T09:13:22+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-09-25T00:04:20+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "失踪人口回归！去年九月份我当爸爸了，我们夫妻两人独立带娃，时间少了很多，所以更新频率降低了很多，在今年 2 月份还是完成了人生一个里程碑的事件，我的第一个出海产品，简单简历的英文版：TailwindResume https://tailwindresume.co/ 正式上线了。直接说结论，我通过冷启动的方式在两周内收获 50 个用户，赚到了 100 美元，不是特别惊人，所以非常真实，是每个想出海的独立开发者都可以完全复制的经验，下面是整个过程的记录。\n\n文字版：https://vikingz.me/fir", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 10705, "danmaku": 2, "favorites": 701}, "tags": ["AI IN ALL！", "出海", "全栈开发", "一人公司", "编程", "自由职业", "独立开发", "前端开发"], "links": ["https://tailwindresume.co/", "https://vikingz.me/fir"], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1kBQeYiEpv", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20260924T235719"}
